{"4756820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crosswinds", "steam_appid": 4756820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4756820/extras/5d9f2c92fe06d8c64385992b2fd32bc9.avif?t=1780611246\" width=1143 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a fictional version of the 1930s Mediterranean coast, this <strong>flying adventure</strong> follows a couple of casino swindlers who must <strong>go their separate ways</strong> after a failed heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Charles</strong>, a WWI veteran pilot searching for <strong>Anna</strong>, your partner in crime. Fly through beautiful, contemplative landscapes, follow intimate clues, and walk through picturesque coastal villages to uncover her whereabouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a deeper understanding of your relationship as you <strong>embark on a multilayered journey</strong> filled with introspection, melancholy, and soul-searching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4756820/extras/3a624c1482172ef6fbcea4200a441add.webp?t=1780611246\" width=1143 height=39 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4756820/extras/0185641b5bc9b34146443927af60c6f6.avif?t=1780611246\" width=1143 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the tranquil joy of coastal aviation. <i>Crosswinds</i> offers a <strong>relaxing</strong>, visually captivating escape where you pilot a seaplane over idyllic Mediterranean towns. Let the <strong>stunning</strong> <strong>art style</strong> and <strong>gentle atmosphere</strong> guide you into a <strong>meditative state</strong> of mind as you drift above picturesque cliffs and sunlit waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4756820/extras/3a624c1482172ef6fbcea4200a441add.webp?t=1780611246\" width=1143 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4756820/extras/b8ebc06b15b02a2a1f651907125c3731.avif?t=1780611246\" width=1143 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Crosswinds</i>, your decisions carry real weight. The intricate balance between <strong>love</strong> and <strong>ambition</strong> shifts with every choice you make, directly reshaping the narrative. Forge your own path through adult relationships where nothing is black and white. Your insights will not only steer the romance toward multiple distinct endings, but also dictate which side quests and optional missions open up—or close forever—along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4756820/extras/3a624c1482172ef6fbcea4200a441add.webp?t=1780611246\" width=1143 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4756820/extras/f75a6cfea66d6ffcb461b09d65d90300.avif?t=1780611246\" width=1143 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour a cup of coffee and settle in. With its distinct European comic-book art style and a soothing jazz soundtrack, <i>Crosswinds</i> delivers a relaxing café-like feeling. Explore picturesque coastal settings at your own leisure in a game designed to be savored, one sip at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i